</surname><given-names>WW</given-names></name></person-group><source>Principles of instructional design</source><year>1992</year><edition>4</edition><publisher-name>Fort Worth, TX: Harcourt Brace Javonovich College Publishers</publisher-name></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>